From 34a40520186710ab4e7eaa5f881310c52b619797 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 05:49:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] PS7 GUI host: exit priority, pwsh -File style argument
 binding, CI-safe error log; add host logic tests

- Program.cs: explicit 'exit N' (SetShouldExit) wins over non-terminating errors; normal end returns 0
  (no $LASTEXITCODE leak); PWX_ERROR_LOG env var writes fatal messages to a file instead of a MessageBox
- ScriptArguments.cs: -Name value, -Name:value, [switch] (no value consumption), prefix abbreviations
- tests: Test-GuiHostLogic.ps1 (runs on pwsh 7 without Windows), gui-edge.ps1 sample,
  Run-Smoke T-GUI-001..009 with timeout-safe Start-Process helper, T-006 positional arg (PS7)
- CI: fast ubuntu host-logic job, upload logs
